<body class="letter-page">

<div class="background">
<div class="particles"></div>
</div>

<div class="letter-container">

<div class="letter" id="letter">

<div class="letter-front">

<h2>💌</h2>

<h1>Open Letter</h1>

<p>Tap To Open</p>

</div>

<div class="letter-back">

<h2>❤️</h2>

<p>

Dua hai teri mohabbat ke siwa koi aur na mile.

<br><br>

Zindagi mein sirf tu mile...

<br><br>

Ya phir zindagi na mile. ❤️

</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

